+ Introduction to the 
+National Flood Insurance 
+Program (NFIP) 
+Founded in 1968, the NFIP protects Americans against the fnancial 
+hardships of fooding. The NFIP has a proud legacy of helping people 
+before, during and after food disasters. 
+Over the next 50 years—and beyond—the NFIP is charting a bold 
+course. The goal is to double the number of properties covered by food 
+insurance and quadruple the amount invested in mitigation. 
+To reach these goals, the NFIP is reducing complexity, updating offerings, 
+improving the claims process, and increasing transparency. And above 
+all, the program will continue to ensure that our policyholders and our 
+customers are foremost on our minds. 
