+Pre-Flood Insurance Rate Map (FIRM) buildings are those built 
+before the effective date of the frst food map for a community. 
+Post-Flood Insurance Rate Map (FIRM) buildings are new 
+construction and those built after the effective date of the frst food 
+map for a community. 
