+vising or updating a Flood Hazard 
+Boundary Map (FHBM) or food map, the 30-day waiting period 
+does not apply if coverage is purchased within a year of the food 
+map revision; or 
+The 30-da
+y waiting period does not apply if a property has been 
+affected by fooding from federal land caused by post-wildfre 
+conditions. 
