find out information about the A-Tax and revenue subject to the Accommodations Tax Please use this form to report revenue subject to the Town of Pawleys Island accommodations tax. Reports should be submitted monthly to Town Hall. Local A-Tax Reporting Form This form covers the period through the last day of the month and becomes DELINQUENT if payment is POSTMARKED by the US Postal Service after the 20th day of the following month. Building Department The Building Department is located at Town Hall at 323 Myrtle Ave. This is a division of the Town Administration and is accessible during normal business hours which are 9:00 AM until 5:00 PM Monday through Friday. The primary goal of the Building Department is to provide professional, courteous, and efficient customer service to contractors, builders, and architects assisting property owners of the Town of Pawleys Island. Please bring completed building permit applications to the Town Hall or email applications to the Town Clerk, Corey Higdon at chigdon@townofpi.com and/or the Town Administrator, Dan Newquist at dnewquist@townofpi.com . Click here for all permits and forms associated with the Building Department. Beach Wheelchair The Town of Pawleys Island has a beach wheelchair that can be used on the beach by persons who have difficulty walking in sand. It is available free of charge on a first-come, first-served basis by calling the Pawleys Island Town Hall at 843-237-1698. The chair is located at the south end beach access and may only be used on the beach in the vicinity of that access. Please contact Town Hall for additional information and rules for use of the chairs. Please complete the form below and email it to chigdon@townofpi.com to reserve a time slot. Beach Wheelchair Release Form Beach Fire Permit NOT AVAILABLE FOR USE OUTSIDE OF TOWN LIMITS. If you are unsure what are the Town limits please contact Town Hall. Please be advised that during Turtle Nesting Season from May 1st to October 1st, Town Staff may request that you move the location of your fire if a turtle nest is known to exist within 100ft of the location indicated on your permit application Permit Rules 1. ONLY CHARCOAL MAY BE BURNED. 2. Cooking purposes only. 3. Fire must be contained in sand pit. 4. Person obtaining permit is responsible for damages cause by fire or litter left on beach. 5. Penalty for violation $50.00 minimum. Beach Fire Permit Please direct all questions to the Town Clerk, Corey Higdon (chigdon@townofpi.com) or call Town Hall (843) 237-1698 Pawleys Island Town Hall is located at 323 Myrtle Ave, Pawleys Island, SC 29585. Facebook-f Twitter Instagram Town of Pawleys Island 323 Myrtle Avenue Pawleys Island, SC 29585 843-237-1698 843-237-7083 Mon - Fri 9:00 am - 5:00 pm Town of Pawleys Island 323 Myrtle Avenue Pawleys Island, SC 29585 843-237-1698 843-237-7083 Mon - Fri 9:00 am - 5:00 pm Pawleys Island weather Facebook-f Twitter Instagram Town of Pawleys Island 323 Myrtle Avenue Pawleys Island, SC 29585 843-237-1698 843-237-7083 Mon - Fri 9:00 am - 5:00 pm Pawleys Island weather Copyright © 2026 Town of Pawleys Island. Site Design by The Impact Guys . Scroll to Top 
