+      h.p(`The town works to lower what island owners pay for flood insurance. It takes part in FEMA's Community Rating System at Class 5, which takes 25 percent off flood insurance premiums on the island. FEMA's base flood elevation for island houses is 12 to 16 feet, and the town requires a new house to sit 3 feet higher than that.`) +
