+      h.p(`Yes, within limits that matter most at the south end. The state draws two lines along the beach: a baseline at the crest of the front dune, and a setback line 20 feet landward of it. On about 100 of the island's roughly 220 oceanfront houses, part of the house stands on the ocean side of the setback line: ${PAST.south} of ${PAST.southOf} at the south end. On Litchfield's ocean side it is ${PAST.litch} of ${PAST.litchOf}.`) +
